<title>ESTONIA: HOIU EXPLORES MERGER POSSIBILITIES.</title>
<headline>HOIU EXPLORES MERGER POSSIBILITIES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank supervisory board head Joakim Helenius said on Tuesday the board has authorised the bank's management to explore the possibilities of merger with any other local commercial bank.</p>
<p>&quot;The supervisory board has authorised the management to explore the possibilities of any strategic merger with Estonia's commercial banks,&quot; Helenius told a news conference.</p>
<p>Hoiupank said earlier it was mulling the idea of merging with a local commercial bank and is most interested in Tallinna Pank and Forekspank .</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
